# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KORR Building Co — what does NOT belong in the deployed repo.
# Anything committed here is publicly served by Netlify, so keep it to the
# files the site actually needs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# NOTE ON THE CAMERA ORIGINALS
# images/**/*.jpeg and "add images/" are ~81 MB the site never serves — it uses
# the -640/-1280 .webp variants only. They are deliberately still tracked,
# because this repo is currently their only off-machine copy. Once they are
# backed up somewhere else, uncommenting the block below drops the repo from
# ~96 MB to ~15 MB.
#
# images/**/*.jpeg
# images/**/*.jpg
# images/**/*.png
# add images/

